# PLDI running example: uniform-increment walk
# Source: Central Moment Analysis for Cost Accumulators in Probabilistic Programs (2021), Figure 2 / Example 2.1, PDF p.3
# URL: https://arxiv.org/pdf/2001.10150
# Independently normalized pseudocode; NOT a native input file for any baseline tool.
# C is a ghost counter: one increment per loop-body execution; not CFG runtime.

# Parameter: d > 0. Set d before running a concrete instance.
x := 0;
C := 0;
while x < d do
    C := C + 1;
    r ~ Uniform(-1, 2);
    x := x + r
od
